    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρφοβ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very fearful, timid,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				3.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					58.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> causal,
				<i>very terrible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγειν τὰ φαῦλα μείζω καὶ τὰ δείν᾽
					ὑπέρφοβα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					497
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ φόβον</span>
			, ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.38.3a
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Da.</u>
				7.19
			</span></i>.</div>
